<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify;">{!Lead.FirstName},<br><br>Thank you for activating your Working Capital Account!<br></p><ul style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><li>Credit Limit:&nbsp; Can qualify up to $500,000</li><li>Contact Us Now: &nbsp;(888) 733-9678</li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify;">You've gotten this far in business by making smart decisions.&nbsp; Now it is time to make another one.&nbsp; Use your Account to get cash for your business.&nbsp; You decide how you want to use the money.&nbsp; For over 16 years we've helped thousands of businesses with cash needs to expand, purchase inventory, advertise, make payroll, and pay other expenses. &nbsp;Here's a short video explaining how easy it is to work with us:<br><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br><b>Video:</b></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;<u><font color="#3333ff" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://www.nationalfunding.com/videos/how-to-apply-for-a-small-business-loan/">How To Apply For A Small Business Loan</a></font></u></span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br>It only takes a few minutes to get started. &nbsp;Receive a decision in minutes and funding in as little as 1 business day.<br></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br>Give us a call at (888) 733-9678 and we can discuss your options to see what suits your business the best.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong><em>National Funding</em></strong><br>Phone:&nbsp; (888) 733-9678</font></p><p><font size="3" face="Arial, sans-serif">Email:&nbsp;<a href="mailto:leasing@nationalfunding.com">apply@nationalfunding.com</a></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify;"><br></p>]]></td>
</tr>
